# One dihedral per residue per frame: v1's context in residue(:) is an array of sets with one set, set by set
# data: 1ALA-560ns.pdb
=== v1
t = dihedral(name("N"), name("CA"), name("C"), name("O")) in residue(:);
=== vial
t = dihedral(residues and particles(name='N'), residues and particles(name='CA'), residues and particles(name='C'), residues and particles(name='O'))
